,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.278614944,"data":"        *(buf0+14) = ((*(buf0+14))+(exp2((((val6.x-val9.x)+alu15)*1.4426950216293335f))*val14.x*val17.x)+(exp2((((val6.y-val9.y)+alu15)*1.4426950216293335f))*\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.279477868,"data":"        *(buf0+15) = ((*(buf0+15))+(exp2((((val6.x-val10.x)+alu16)*1.4426950216293335f))*val14.x*val18.x)+(exp2((((val6.y-val10.y)+alu16)*1.4426950216293335f)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.280353385,"data":"    \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.281280584,"data":"      ^ note what is NOT here: no tensor-core MMA (`tl.dot` equivalent),\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.28215458,"data":"        no `exp2`, and the decay is a [C,C,K] tensor that had to be\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.283031315,"data":"        materialised before the reduction over K could happen.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.283928613,"data":"    \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.284828196,"data":"    ==============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.285687712,"data":"    SIDE BY SIDE\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.28660889,"data":"    ==============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.287496565,"data":"      step       TRITON (fla, hand-written)                           TINYGRAD\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.288434154,"data":"      --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.289355827,"data":"      grid       grid = (NT, NC, B * HV)            # NT=T/64, NC=64/ \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.290254621,"data":"      constexpr  BT = 64;  BC = 16;  NC = cdiv(BT, BC) = 4            \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.29101086,"data":"      load       b_k0  = tl.load(p_k0, mask=m_ck0).to(tl.float32)     \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.2916889,"data":"      load       b_g0  = tl.load(p_g0, mask=m_ck0).to(tl.float32)     \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.292365568,"data":"      load       b_gn1 = tl.load(g + ... + o_k, mask=m_k).to(tl.float \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.293072632,"data":"      decay      b_gqn = tl.where(m_tc1[:, None], exp2(b_g1 - b_gn1[N \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.29379834,"data":"      decay      b_kgt = tl.trans(b_k0 * exp2(b_gn1[None, :] - b_g0)) \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.294464688,"data":"      mma        b_Akk10 = tl.dot(b_k1 * b_gqn, b_kgt, b_Akk10)       \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.295149906,"data":"      store      tl.store(p_Akk10, b_Akk10.to(dtype), mask=m_c1)      \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.295849478,"data":"                 the [BC, BC] score block never leaves registers; the only\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.29661655,"data":"                 extra buffer is Akkd = empty(B, T, HV, BC) -- [T,16], not [T,T]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.297373905,"data":"    \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.298111677,"data":"      TinyGrad's equivalent of the three Triton lines is:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.298816408,"data":"          decay = (gcum[:,:,:, :,None] - gcum[:,:,:,None,:]).exp()   -\u003e [C,C,K]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.299463366,"data":"          gram  = (decay * k[:,:,:,:,None] * k[:,:,:,None,:]).sum(-1) -\u003e [C,C]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.300136272,"data":"      Same result, but the intermediate is C x C x K instead of BC x K,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.300876573,"data":"      and the contraction is a generic sum() rather than a tensor-core MMA.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":248.301518889,"data":"  [ok     ] codegen_diff           2.1s  generated code vs hand-written Triton\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":276.228898181,"data":"\n"}
